WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:07.520
What's up everybody!

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:08.520
We are Pongfinity

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:10.120
And welcome to another episode of

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:11.350
Challenge Pongfinity

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:12.700
This is the series where YOU

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:13.870
Challenge US

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:16.180
With your craziest ideas related to table
tennis.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.369
If your comment gets picked

00:00:17.369 --> 00:00:18.830
We will feature it in our next video

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:20.420
And give you a shout out.

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:22.190
So make sure you leave your comments and ideas

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:23.960
In the comment-section below!

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:30.340
Otto-Pekka Ojala wants us to play with rocks.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:31.680
This is my weapon

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:35.140
And Miikka and Emil can challenge me with
these.

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:38.880
This shouldn't be so hard.

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:20.800
This one is from Leo Solheimslid Johansen

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:23.200
He wants us to see us do 60 shots each

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:25.079
In under 1 minute.

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:29.280
I'm sure we will do it under 50 seconds.

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:22.160
So that was 120 shots.

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:35.440
Now it's time to play with this chain saw.

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:37.440
Let's go!

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.200
Thanks for watching guys

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:12.569
Hope you enjoyed it!

00:04:12.569 --> 00:04:15.160
If you have an even crazier item we should
play with

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:16.370
In the next video

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:18.410
Leave a comment in the comment-section.

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:19.650
Remember to subscribe

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:22.150
And watch our previous episodes here.

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:22.830
Until next time!

